// Dialog :
"P4025761563" "With the assistance of Dr. Zaahn, you were able to prevent the dimensional shunt and saved the Portal Corporation lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P506141053" "You failed to prevent the dimensional shunt. The building still stands, but the Lab is gone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P350604383" "That was a near thing, {HeroName}. That whole building might simply have been sent to another dimension. The Sky Raiders are ruthless about cleaning up their crimes, but I didn't think they were willing to go that far."
// RandomFameString :
"P3351950213" "Word is that {HeroName} saved Portal Corp's bacon earlier, but no one is giving any details."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2631716987" "The facility is...gone. There are just empty floors where the lab used to be. It's a miracle you weren't taken with it, {HeroName}. You may have to thank Dr. Zaahn for that, if Portal Corp can ever find her and the lab."
// RandomFameString :
"P3463151660" "One of the Portal Corp facilities vanished in a flash of light. No one seems to be talking about what happened."

