// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DocBradleyStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3765505754" "Dr. Bradley conversation"
// DetailString :
"P2102502721" "When you rescued him, Dr. Bradley told you:<br><br>'It's lucky you arrived when you did. The Sky Raiders were going to take anything that wasn't bolted fast! They wouldn't have found much here, however, as we had just transferred much of the Rikti technology we had been studying to another facility. However, they spoke of being a tight schedule to finish this series of raids, so I'm afraid they may be planning to strike other locations.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - JumpbotMemoryUnit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P502607695" "Jumpbot memory unit"
// DetailString :
"P3152173130" "You recovered this memory core from a Sky Raider Jumpbot during battle. It may contain useful data. Justine Kelly, the noted computer hacker, might be able to reveal it's secrets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SkyRaiderStagingArea 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1833505899" "Sky Raider coordinates"
// DetailString :
"P2410639149" "Justine Kelly was able to pry a great deal of information from the Jumpbot memory core you captured, including a return location that should lead right back to the Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P133265732" "The Sky Raiders were recently stealing Rikti technology for a European crime syndicate. Interpol caught the syndicate's buyers, but not the Sky Raider contacts. Officially, the case is closed, but I think the Sky Raiders may try to make some side money by stealing more Rikti technology. We have their list of targets facilities, and I've been asking heroes to check things out. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Could you go to one of the targeted research facilities make certain that Dr. Brandon Bradley and his people are safe?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P150673552" "Check the research facility and make certain that Dr. Bradley and his people are safe"
// SendOffString :
"P3895868135" "If the Sky Raiders are going to attack that lab, you'll have your work cut out for you. Ensuring the safety of Dr. Bradley and his people will be your top priority. Also, the Sky Raiders employed jump-bots on each of the previous thefts, so if they do hit this place, you'll have to take it out too."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_SkyRaiders_Compound1.1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P870665751" "Defeat lead Raider, his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4292601134" "If the Sky Raiders attack that lab, you'll have to Ensure the safety of Dr. Bradley and his people. Also, the Sky Raiders employed jump-bots on each of the previous thefts, so it's likely you'll have to take one out, too."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P601842426" "The improved security of this facility has obviously been bypassed. It looks like the Sky Raiders are already on the attack."

