"P3710386631" "You did a great job fighting through what was starting to look like a total mess. I'm guessing the Lost tried to jump the Sky Raiders to steal whatever Rikti devices they'd found and sell them. It is kind of weird that they acted so quickly, though, but there are a lot of mysteries about the Lost. The important thing is that you stopped the Sky Raiders."
// RandomFameString :
"P49100679" "Justine Kelly told me that {HeroName} is foiling the Sky Raiders, as usual."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_SkyRaiders_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1254000727" "The Sky Raiders have been increasing the tempo of their operations, apparently they think that a couple successes against some of the city's younger heroes makes them unstoppable. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like to see them get stopped, hard, and I would like to see you do it.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1008205808" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Sky Raiders"
// SendOffString :
"P3110937479" "The Sky Raiders got a few successes in Terra Volta recently, but wherever or whenever you can stop their actions is a good place to start."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3648235160" "Combat Sky Raider menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2421227401" "The Sky Raiders still aren't convinced that you mean business. You might need to  defeat some more of them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3464904039" "You have defeated out enough Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1107894833" "The Sky Raiders are a pretty bold and gung-ho outfit. But I think you've done a great job of showing them that their kind of law-breaking won't be tolerated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_SkyRaiders_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1357987006" "The Sky Raiders are starting to get out of control in Terra Volta. Their raids and constant thefts are a real hazard to the complex's continued operations. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who is willing to confront them and stop some of their actions in Terra Volta.</A> "
// AcceptString :
"P4106144953" "Fight the Sky Raiders in Terra Volta"
// SendOffString :
"P547326669" "The Sky Raiders have been spotted all over Terra Volta, but if you're having trouble looking for them, I'm sure you'll find them around the Rogers Industries facility and the Gordon Trench, though you shouldn't have to confine yourself to those area."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1841554676" "Combat Raiders in Terra Volta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3750561998" "The Sky Raiders in Terra Volta aren't going to defeat themselves, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3596660814" "{HeroName} located. Making attack run!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1127285605" "You have cleared enough Sky Raiders from Terra Volta to put a dent in their operations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3090755582" "The Sky Raiders may be able to fly, but you've shown them that they aren't above the law, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_SkyRaiders_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3930962064" "The word is out that the Sky Raiders think that they're close to being unopposed in Terra Volta. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to show them just how wrong they are.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1787063741" "Defeat Sky Raiders in Terra Volta"
// SendOffString :
"P3401911626" "The Sky Raiders shouldn't be hard to find, but I've heard that the Challenger Technology center and the Carter Engineering complex are particularly overrun right now. That doesn't mean you have to confine yourself to those areas, though."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4034007115" "Sky Raider operations are a threat to all of Terra Volta, and that means they're a threat to the City at large."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P585506193" "{HeroName} spotted. Commencing attack!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2059364657" "You have defeated enough Sky Raiders in Terra Volta."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1845041690" "The word is out that the Sky Raiders are reassessing their activities after the battle you gave them. Good work."
